        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">First Battle of the Marne</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Date</span><span class="info-stat-val">5 to 12 September 1914; the German retreat is also dated 9 to 13 September</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Place</span><span class="info-stat-val">Between <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/paris">Paris</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/verdun">Verdun</a> along the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/marne">Marne</a> valley, northern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/france">France</a>, on a west-to-east front of 230 km; the most severe fighting was in the western half</span></div>
